io</span><span begin="00:42.170" end="00:42.170">, </span><span begin="00:42.170" end="00:42.350">but </span><span begin="00:42.350" end="00:42.440">I </span><span begin="00:42.440" end="00:42.680">don't </span><span begin="00:42.680" end="00:42.980">care </span><span begin="00:42.980" end="00:43.130">for </span><span begin="00:43.130" end="00:43.490">sand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.580" end="00:46.760"><span begin="00:43.580" end="00:44.060">Lighting </span><span begin="00:44.060" end="00:44.150">the </span><span begin="00:44.150" end="00:44.480">fuse </span><span begin="00:44.480" end="00:44.690">might </span><span begin="00:44.690" end="00:45.110">result </span><span begin="00:45.110" end="00:45.230">in </span><span begin="00:45.230" end="00:45.320">a </span><span begin="00:45.320" end="00:45.650">bang </span><span begin="00:45.650" end="00:45.770">b</span><span begin="00:45.770" end="00:45.890">-</span><span begin="00:45.890" end="00:45.950">b</span><span begin="00:45.950" end="00:46.010">-</span><span begin="00:46.010" end="00:46.220">bang</span><span begin="00:46.220" end="00:46.250">-</span><span begin="00:46.250" end="00:46.760">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.970" end="00:49.610"><span begin="00:46.970" end="00:47.090">I </span><span begin="00:47.090" end="00:47.420">bet </span><span begin="00:47.420" end="00:47.720">that </span><span begin="00:47.720" end="00:47.990">you </span><span begin="00:47.990" end="00:48.260">look </span><span begin="00:48.260" end="00:48.530">good </span><span begin="00:48.530" end="00:48.710">on </span><span begin="00:48.710" end="00:48.830">the </span><span begin="00:48.830" end="00:49.340">dance </span><span begin="00:49.340" end="00:49.610">floor</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.610" end="00:52.070"><span begin="00:49.610" end="00:49.730">I </span><span begin="00:49.730" end="00:50.030">don't </span><span begin="00:50.030" end="00:50.330">know </span><span begin="00:50.330" end="00:50.490">if </span><span begin="00:50.490" end="00:50.640">you're </span><span begin="00:50.640" end="00:50.900">looking </span><span begin="00:50.900" end="00:51.050">for </span><span begin="00:51.050" end="00:51.740">romance </span><span begin="00:51.740" end="00:52.070">or</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.070" end="00:54.890"><span begin="00:52.070" end="00:52.340">Don't </span><span begin="00:52.340" end="00:52.580">know </span><span begin="00:52.580" end="00:52.850">what </span><span begin="00:52.850" end="00:53.030">you're </span><span begin="00:53.030" end="00:53.780">looking </span><span begin="00:53.780" end="00:54.890">for</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.850" end="00:59.300"><span begin="00:55.850" end="00:56.090">I </span><span begin="00:56.090" end="00:56.360">said </span><span begin="00:56.360" end="00:56.450">I </span><span begin="00:56.450" end="00:56.750">bet </span><span begin="00:56.750" end="00:57.050">that </span><span begin="00:57.050" end="00:57.320">you </span><span begin="00:57.320" end="00:57.650">look </span><span begin="00:57.650" end="00:57.890">good </span><span begin="00:57.890" end="00:58.070">on </span><span begin="00:58.070" end="00:58.190">the </span><span begin="00:58.190" end="00:58.730">dance </span><span begin="00:58.730" end="00:59.300">floor</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:59.330" end="01:04.010"><span begin="00:59.330" end="00:59.690">Dancing </span><span begin="00:59.690" end="00:59.900">to </span><span begin="00:59.900" end="01:00.500">electro</span><span begin="01:00.500" end="01:00.530">-</span><span begin="01:00.530" end="01:00.830">pop </span><span begin="01:00.830" end="01:01.130">like </span><span begin="01:01.130" end="01:01.220">a </span><span begin="01:01.220" end="01:01.760">robot </span><span begin="01:01.760" end="01:01.940">from </span><span begin="01:01.940" end="01:04.010">1984</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.010" end="01:14.570"><span begin="01:04.010" end="01:04.220">From </span><span be